o2.jpg"}, {"id": 1959117, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15znx.jpg"}, {"id": 1959115, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15znv.jpg"}, {"id": 1959118, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15zny.jpg"}, {"id": 1959123, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15zo3.jpg"}, {"id": 1959125, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15zo5.jpg"}], "slug": "too-slow-again", "summary": "Too Slow Again is a first-person shooter in which every level is a race against the clock. On each track the player has to eliminate every target, complete its objectives and reach the finish line as fast as possible: every hit taken adds two seconds, dying ends the run and restarts are instant, with nothing left to chance. Over 100 tracks are split into weapon circuits for the assault rifle, pistol, shotgun and sniper rifle, set in a bright, flooded white city where glass, screens, steam pipes and gas cans break and explode. Movement includes sprinting, sliding, vaulting, climbing, leaning, ziplines and rappelling. Bronze, silver and gold medals and a leaderboard on every track measure each run, weapons level up from 1 to 50 to unlock attachments, and the Duo and Squad circuits are built for online co-op with two and four players.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/too-slow-again", "videos": [{"id": 200439, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "OvH1TEVcegw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvH1TEVcegw", "title": "Too Slow Again \u2014 Official Teaser Trailer | Fast FPS (4K)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OvH1TEVcegw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}